    "https://www.jobs.gla.ac.uk/jobs/multimorbidity-phd-programme-for-health-professionals-fellow?source=google.com": {
      "title": "Multiple Longterm Conditions Phd Program jobs · University of Glasgow",
      "description": "Multiple Longterm Conditions Phd Program jobs · University of Glasgow This website uses cookies to ensure you get the best experience. read more Got it! Sort by Relevance College/US College of Medical Veterinary & Life Sci 1 School/Service School of Health & Wellbeing 1 Job Type Multiple Longterm Conditions Phd Program 1 Vacancies About Us Contact Why UofG Login Register Login Menu Vacancies About Us Why UofG Contact Sign In Refine Search Sort by Relevance College/US College of Medical Veterinary & Life Sci 1 School/Service School of Health & Wellbeing 1 Job Type Multiple Longterm Conditions Phd Program 1 No jobs found in '%input%' Reset Search Multiple Longterm Conditions Phd Program jobs Found 1 job Multiple Long-Term Conditions PhD Programme for Health Professionals Fellow Posted\n26 days\nago The Clinical PhD Research Fellowships are fixed term 3-year appointments offering training, mentoring and support to health professionals undertaking a PhD on the topic of multiple long-term conditions (MLTC), also known as multimorbidity. Save Job Apply Now Read More Get new jobs for this search by email Sign in or register here to receive emails about new jobs like these The University of Glasgow is a registered Scottishcharity: Registration Number SC004401 X Facebook instagram Legal Cookies Terms of use PeopleXD accessibilty statement Candidate privacy notice Accreditation Quick Links About Contact Us Vacancies Salaries Applicant Guide All Right Reserved 2026 University of Glasgow Recruitment website by Close menu"
